<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at</p>
<p>$450,000 Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 6-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Magdalena Maleeva</p>
<p>(Bulgaria) 6-0 7-5</p>
</text>
